  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Shang Yan Fei tells Wei Yang not to undervalue himself. Wei Yang is hindered by lacking aptitude; otherwise, with his talent, he would be even more outstanding. Shang Yan Fei says there is no need to worry: if a reform Gu appears, he will definitely help Wei Yang get it. Reform Gu could raise a Gu Master’s aptitude. It was extremely rare and expensive. Wei Yang answers that he will not forget this kindness for as long as he lives.",
